{"id":"0d7992268a3e1438","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bipartitequadratic.md","title":"Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation","display":"thm-bipartitequadratic — Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bipartitequadratic","aliases":["27-thm-bipartitequadratic"],"display":"thm-bipartitequadratic — Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.5.2 Equation (5.6)","source_statement":"Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation","source_printed_pages":"219","source_pdf_pages":"243","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bipartitequadratic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bipartitequadratic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bipartitequadratic — Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.5.2 Equation (5.6)"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d7992268a3e1438\" href=\"?note=0d7992268a3e1438\" title=\"Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation\">Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"219"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"243"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in N\\land i&lt;j\\}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in N\\land i&lt;j\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,E)\">\\(G=(N,E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bipartite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bipartite}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_E:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(b_E:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists V_0,V_1\\subseteq N\\;(V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\\land V_0\\cup V_1=N\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap V_0|=|e\\cap V_1|=1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists V_0,V_1\\subseteq N\\;(V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\\land V_0\\cup V_1=N\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap V_0|=|e\\cap V_1|=1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_E(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}\\left(1-a_ia_j\\right)\\left(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j)\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_E(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}\\left(1-a_ia_j\\right)\\left(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j)\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(b_E(a)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(b_E(a)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条边的两个违例项恰好禁止两端同色。将取值0与1的顶点分别放入 V0、V1 即得两方向的见证。无边图及 n=0 都可二分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation","status":"resolved","id":"0d7992268a3e1438","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in N\\land i<j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bipartite}","display":false},{"tex":"b_E:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists V_0,V_1\\subseteq N\\;(V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\\land V_0\\cup V_1=N\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;(|e\\cap V_0|=|e\\cap V_1|=1)).","display":true},{"tex":"b_E(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}\\left(1-a_ia_j\\right)\\left(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j)\\right),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bipartite}(G)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(b_E(a)=0).","display":true}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-bipartitequadratic|thm-bipartitequadratic — Bipartite graph coloring as a quadratic zero equation]]"}],"outgoing":[]}